griffel (51.0.0~rc1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release candidate of the 51.0.0 series.
  * Fix the Code Mode (F8) and spell-check (F7) toggles never switching
    off: the action state was set through a lookup that never resolved.
  * Make ``` fences type literally in Code Mode: the third backtick no
    longer auto-pairs and strands the cursor inside the fence.
  * Add gettext translations with catalogs for German, Spanish, French,
    Italian, Brazilian Portuguese, Dutch, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian,
    Simplified Chinese and Japanese.

 -- hakergeniusz <hakergeniusz@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

